WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.930
Look out in any direction, and distant
galaxies are moving away from us.

2
00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:08.890
The further away a galaxy
is, the faster it recedes.

3
00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:12.920
Trace them all back, and everything
was once packed into a hot,

4
00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:15.060
dense early universe.

5
00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:17.260
So where did the Big Bang happen?

6
00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:18.180
Right here?

7
00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:19.620
Somewhere far off?

8
00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:21.330
Can we point to the spot?

9
00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:25.680
In this mission, you'll find out
why galaxies themselves do not grow,

10
00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:27.860
even as the universe expands.

11
00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:33.010
Then you'll change your viewpoint, and
picture the sky as seen from another galaxy.

12
00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:36.570
Your mission: find out where
the Big Bang took place,

13
00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:37.800
and explain why.
